        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Uhoraho atuma Natani kuri Dawidi; araza, aramubarira, ati Hār’ abantu babiri bāba mu gisagara kimwe, umwe w’umutunzi, uwundi w’umworo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uwo mutunzi yar’ afise amasinzi y’intama n’inka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nya mworo nta co yar’ afise, atar’ akāgazi k’intama kamwe yari yaraguze, akakarera, kagakura kari kumwe na we n’abana biwe, kakarya ku two kurya twiwe, kakanywera mu gikombe ciwe, kakāma karyama mu gikiriza ciwe, kakamumerera nk’umukobga yivyariye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye haza umushitsi kwa nya mutunzi, na we yanka gukora mu ntama ziwe canke mu nka, ngw azimane uwo mushitsi amugendeye, arikw ahitana wa mwana w’intama wa nya mworo, ayibāgira umushitsi wiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ uburake bga Dawidi buca buziriringira uwo muntu; abarira Natani, ati Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’Uhoraho, uwakoze ivyo yar’ akwiye gupfa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
